    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but \"enforcing existing rules\" hasn't really worked so far, has it? it feels like these companies are so huge they're basically above the law at this point. if we just keep doing the same thing, aren't we basically just letting them run the whole economy without any actual oversight? do you think there's any point in even trying regulation if they just have the resources to bypass it?",
